      "markscheme_text": "attempting to use the quotient rule to find $\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\frac{x^{2}-1}{x^{2}+1}\\right)$\n$$\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\frac{x^{2}-1}{x^{2}+1}\\right) = \\frac{2x(x^{2}+1)-2x(x^{2}-1)}{(x^{2}+1)^{2}} \\left(= \\frac{4x}{(x^{2}+1)^{2}}\\right)$$\nattempting to use the chain rule to find $\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{x^{2}-1}{x^{2}+1}\\right)\\right)$\nlet $u = \\frac{x^{2}-1}{x^{2}+1}$ and so $y = \\arcsin{u}$ and $\\frac{dy}{du} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}$\n$$f'(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\frac{x^{2}-1}{x^{2}+1}\\right)^{2}}} \\times \\frac{4x}{(x^{2}+1)^{2}}$$\n$$= \\frac{4x}{\\sqrt{(x^{2}+1)^{2}-(x^{2}-1)^{2}}} \\times \\frac{1}{(x^{2}+1)}$$\n$$= \\frac{4x}{\\sqrt{4x^{2}}} \\times \\frac{1}{(x^{2}+1)}$$\n$$= \\frac{2x}{\\sqrt{x^{2}}(x^{2}+1)}$$"
    },
